      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُقُوبٌ</span></b>  a pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَقْبٌ</span> [q. v.]. (S, M, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
Also The <i>kind legs</i> of camels; a dial. var. of
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُقُوبٌ</span>: (IAar, M:) the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">س</span> is changed into <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ص</span>
app. because the latter is more agreeable with
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ق</span>. (M.)

